To resolve this, ensure the target `.blk` files are closed. If they are, try running your IDE (Spyder) as Administrator.

Additionally, your code currently only processes files directly in `Second_folder`. If you want to include files in subdirectories, use `os.walk`:

```python
for root, _, files in os.walk(FolderPath):
    for filename in files:
        if filename.lower().endswith(".blk"):
            FilePath = os.path.join(root, filename)
            # ... rest of your logic
```
